---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — Evonera Technologies" description="Terms of service for Evonera Technologies Pvt Ltd.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 font-sans">
    <div class="mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-white/10">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-faint">Legal Terms</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-medium text-neutral-100 mt-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-faint mt-2">Evonera Technologies Pvt Ltd · Effective Date: October 28, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-neutral-300 space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-100">1. Consulting & Development Engagements</h2>
        <p>
          Client development and engineering work is covered by a written scope of work with agreed deliverables, milestones, and payment terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-100">2. Code Ownership & Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Code ownership, licenses, and any pre-existing materials used in an engagement will be described in the project agreement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-100">3. Pricing & Payment Terms</h2>
        <p>
          Pricing is agreed in writing before work begins. Any deposit and payment milestones will be set out in the project agreement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-100">4. Warranty & Support Period</h2>
        <p>
          Any included warranty or support period will be described in the project agreement.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
